1.0.1 2026-11-18
  - dataset_description.json: License written as SPDX "CC0-1.0"
  - dataset_description.json ReferencesAndLinks, HowToAcknowledge -> data descriptor doi:10.1038/s41597-026-08125-y (its Data Availability section names doi:10.18112/openneuro.ds007554.v1.0.0)
  - channels.tsv: unique channel names from the SNIRF measurement list (both wavelengths of a channel had the same name)
  - *_nirs.json SamplingFrequency 10 -> 50 in 179 recordings whose SNIRF time axis gives 50 Hz (doi:10.1038/s41597-026-08125-y, Usage Notes: sub-021 to sub-030 recorded at 50 Hz)
  - *_coordsystem.json and *_optodes.tsv added from the SNIRF /nirs/probe
  - *_nirs.json RecordingType -> continuous-wave recordings with a regular SNIRF time vector
  - README.md "Known issues" -> SNIRF metaDataTags LengthUnit/TimeUnit and /nirs/probe of the named files; the channels.tsv and nirs.json files; doi:10.1038/s41597-026-08125-y, Methods "Data acquisition" and Usage Notes
  - Not in this text change (data files): SNIRF LengthUnit mm -> cm
